@NODE Introduction "Introduction & New Features in v2.1 - © 1995 bObO/MST"

   Hi  again, and welcome to another fine product from Mystic-Amiexpress.
   Here  it  is  -  the  new  update  of MultiTop.  It has been completly
   rewritten,  and  today  it's  the  DAMN best top utility available for
   Ami-Express.   It  does  not  only  allow you to make the most of your
   bulletins, but also with your own created design and much much more!

   New in version 2.1:
   ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
   * MultiTop can now generate top upload/download cps rates
   * MultiTop now using a new load/sort routine =50% faster!
   * New config program with nicer design and easier to use.
   * Optimized the code =faster executable!

   Some notable features:
   ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
   * MultiTop  has  got a nice built-in config program that allows you to
     configure your personal settings.
   * MultiTop lets you use your own design.
   * MultiTop generates your top uploaders/downloaders (bytes and files),
     top callers,  top message writers and top upload/download cps rates.
   * MultiTop has been tested on and works 100% on multinode systems.
   * MultiTop is written entirely in C for fast code.
   * MultiTop  comes  in  000 & 0x0 code to get the maximum speed on your
     system.
     Please note that the 030 version will also work on A1200s & A4000s.
   * MultiTop has got everything built-in. No need to create cfgs and
     such things, you control everything in the config editor.
   * Each design file can have its own personal configuration.
   * MultiTop can generate bulletins using your conference databases.
     (You must have Conference Accounting activated to use this.)
   * MultiTop  allow wildcards at the design argument.  This means that
     you can have MultiTop pick random top bulletins.
   * MultiTop can exclude users you don't want to have listed.

   MultiTop  is  your  final  replacement  for  all  your top makers.  It
   doesn't  only  allow you to make your top uploaders bulletin, but also
   top callers and top message writers and much much more.

   As  you  all probably know, there are perhaps fifty other top uploader
   utils  available for Ami-Express today, and all of them with different
   designs.  It is always hard to choose between them, because you really
   don't  know  what design you want to use.  This problem is solved now,
   because MultiTop lets you use your own created design!

   I  hope  that  some  of  you  ascii/ansi  makers will create some nice
   designs for this util in the future.  This way there is no need to any
   other  top utility because all of them really work in the same way but
   with different designs.

             I HAVE CREATED THE CODE, NOW YOU MAKE THE DESIGN!

                                                            -bObO/mYSTiC-

